#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0412 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: On a given record, ANLzzFL is populated and ANLzzFN is not populated
#note "ANL01FL populated, ANL01FN empty -> violation"
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
# Declared-tier scope: the class= declaration disagrees with the columns, so #define must
# carry it to RuleRunner (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ANL01FL type=Char
col ANL01FN type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | VAL | 
---
